The project can't be built directly because it's a .NET Framework web application project that requires Visual Studio build tools with WebApplication.targets. This is not a .NET Core/5+ project. The error is about the project type itself not being buildable with the available SDKs, not about my code change.

Let me verify the syntax is correct by checking the code logic manually. My change adds:

```csharp
// 校验当前userCode对应的用户认证信息，防止越权访问进行账户密码爆破
if (user == null || user.USER_CODE != UserInfo.Current.UserCode)
{
